@style(IDocDemo)
@title(Charts: Change over time)

Lines, areas, steps, candlesticks and timelines. Each chart is followed by the source that drew it, and every example carries its own data.

@table(widths=equal)
@row
@cell
@b{Line}

A quantity as it moves. Several y columns draw several lines.

@graph(type=line, x=year, y=Public;Private, title="Schools over time")
@data
year,Public,Private
2009,98817,33366
2011,98328,30861
2013,98271,33619
2015,98277,34576
2017,98469,32461
2019,98469,30492
@end

